[00:12.02]The spaceship flew around the new planet several times.
[00:16.14]The planet was blue and green.
[00:19.40]They couldn't see the surface of the planet because there were too many white clouds.
[00:24.50]The spaceship descended slowly through the clouds and landed in the middle of a green forest.
[00:31.46]The two astronauts put on their space suits, opened the door, climbed carefully down the ladder, and stepped onto the planet.
[00:42.52]<br>
[00:42.92]The woman looked at a small control unit on her arm.
[00:46.94]'It's all right,' she said to the man.
[00:49.70]“We can breathe the air ...
[00:52.22]It's a mixture of oxygen and nitrogen.”
[00:56.94]Both of them took off their helmets and breathed deeply.
[01:01.04]<br>
[01:02.04]They looked at everything carefully.
[01:04.74]All the plants and animals looked new and strange.
[01:09.22]They couldn't find any intelligent life.
[01:13.58]<br>
[01:13.78]After several hours, they returned to their spaceship.
[01:17.60]Everything looked normal.
[01:20.16]The man switched on the controls, but nothing happened.
[01:25.88]‘Something's wrong?’ he said.
[01:28.68]‘I don't understand ... the engines aren't working.’
[01:32.40]<br>
[01:33.52]He switched on the computer, but that didn't work either.
[01:38.56]‘Eve,’ he said,
[01:41.55]‘We're stuck here.
[01:43.56]... We can't take off!’ ‘Don't worry, Adam,’ she replied.
[01:50.30]‘They'll rescue us soon.’